      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While I agree that the UI could use some un-crowding in some areas, I would still like to be able to review avatar performance stats. I could see the button being moved (maybe to a sub menu of the interaction menu with the rest of the more technical info/buttons) or put in a smaller box, but think the option should at least remain. \n\nI don't often (or really ever) see it used as a means to cross-examine an avatar along with the safety settings, but as more of an insight as to why someone is hidden or something is displayed improperly, to help others debug their avatars, or even just get an idea of what's happening with an avatar. \nIt's been nothing but useful to not only me, but also others I've met in-game as well, and can sometimes become a discussion point, so I for one, can see no use removing it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
